error[E1010]: effect not allowed while rendering: it reaches 'bump', which assigns the field 'value' of an object it did not allocate
  --> $DIR/render-effect-argument.nra:11:46
   |
 7 |     counter.value += 1;
   |     ------------- assigns the field 'value' of an object it did not allocate here
...
11 | let badge = html(counter: Counter) { <span>{ bump(counter) }</span> };
   |                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ calls 'bump' while the view is built
   |
   = note: a template may allocate and read, but it may not write what it did not create, assign a binding, make a host request, start or wait for tasks, or call a function value
   = help: do it in a handler or a command, and pass the result to the factory

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E1010`.
